03:22:32,170 --> 03:22:32,770
No, no.

3696
03:22:33,110 --> 03:22:34,110
I'm misremembering.

3697
03:22:36,570 --> 03:22:37,230
Yeah, yeah.

3698
03:22:38,930 --> 03:22:39,450
Yep.

3699
03:22:39,870 --> 03:22:40,650
That's how you do it.

3700
03:22:40,650 --> 03:22:41,970
And then...

3701
03:22:43,930 --> 03:22:44,970
Let's get the fuck out of here.

3702
03:22:46,670 --> 03:22:47,870
Wait, it goes right through me.

3703
03:22:48,150 --> 03:22:49,430
I'm immune to damage while I'm here.

3704
03:22:51,790 --> 03:22:52,670
Where the heck am I?

3705
03:23:01,240 --> 03:23:01,600
Cool.

3706
03:23:01,780 --> 03:23:02,160
Let's go home.

3707
03:23:05,110 --> 03:23:06,110
Is this a new area?

3708
03:23:07,950 --> 03:23:08,990
Where did we emerge?

3709
03:23:15,030 --> 03:23:19,130
Honestly, I don't mind the longer trip home if we get to spot new things in the world.

3710
03:23:23,670 --> 03:23:24,030
Cows!

3711
03:23:26,110 --> 03:23:27,370
We can instantly make stakes.

3712
03:23:28,230 --> 03:23:29,810
So, of course, we gotta do it.

3713
03:23:32,650 --> 03:23:34,010
We're actually running low on stakes.

3714
03:23:41,620 --> 03:23:41,980
Hey!

3715
03:23:44,020 --> 03:23:44,380
Ha!

3716
03:23:45,460 --> 03:23:46,840
He was put out by the water.

3717
03:23:55,970 --> 03:23:58,270
By the way, you know how I can tell I'm in a new area here?

3718
03:23:58,770 --> 03:24:01,850
So, the game is running so nice now that I can't even tell it's loading, right?

3719
03:24:01,850 --> 03:24:03,730
But I can hear it on my computer.

3720
03:24:03,890 --> 03:24:04,870
It goes...

3721
03:24:06,870 --> 03:24:08,350
When I'm in a new area.

3722
03:24:08,770 --> 03:24:10,310
Because it's loading in this area here.

3723
03:24:11,030 --> 03:24:13,090
And my computer is working overtime to do it.

3724
03:24:34,460 --> 03:24:34,660
Oop.

3725
03:24:34,860 --> 03:24:35,340
Got a lag.

3726
03:24:45,400 --> 03:24:46,820
What are these flowers pointing at?

3727
03:24:49,830 --> 03:24:51,370
Shouldn't they point towards the sun?

3728
03:24:51,910 --> 03:24:53,390
Isn't that what sunflowers do?

3729
03:24:55,530 --> 03:24:57,250
That's why they're called sunflowers?

3730
03:25:01,530 --> 03:25:02,490
Literally unplayable.

3731
03:25:06,420 --> 03:25:07,680
Hand over your meats.

3732
03:25:12,650 --> 03:25:13,210
Oh!

3733
03:25:14,450 --> 03:25:16,150
Oh, I got a new die, I think.

3734
03:25:16,970 --> 03:25:18,030
A yellow one.

3735
03:25:18,850 --> 03:25:19,130
Cool.

3736
03:25:25,360 --> 03:25:26,420
Oh, because of the sunflower.

3737
03:25:26,760 --> 03:25:27,240
Makes sense.

3738
03:25:29,360 --> 03:25:30,240
Let's go boating.

3739
03:25:43,670 --> 03:25:44,230
Whoops.

3740
03:25:44,510 --> 03:25:44,730
Sorry.

3741
03:25:46,810 --> 03:25:49,770
I'm drinking water from an abnormally large flask today.

3742
03:25:52,510 --> 03:25:54,050
And it's kind of unwieldy.

3743
03:25:55,230 --> 03:25:56,510
There's a jungle here.

3744
03:26:09,580 --> 03:26:10,660
Hello, buddy!

3745
03:26:11,700 --> 03:26:12,880
Man, I should get some animals.

3746
03:26:14,140 --> 03:26:16,000
Some cats and some dogs, maybe?

3747
03:26:17,960 --> 03:26:19,420
Just like Jodie Foster.

3748
03:26:20,920 --> 03:26:22,540
Back in my old, old home.

3749
03:26:29,890 --> 03:26:30,910
Oh, hello.

3750
03:26:47,590 --> 03:26:48,570
Let's go here.

3751
03:26:54,190 --> 03:26:55,830
Oh, he died from fire.

3752
03:26:56,110 --> 03:26:57,150
That's so sad.

3753
03:27:10,190 --> 03:27:10,870
Man, how...

3754
03:27:11,230 --> 03:27:12,650
How far away from home am I?

3755
03:27:15,340 --> 03:27:15,920
I don't...

3756
03:27:15,920 --> 03:27:17,260
I have no memory of this place at all.

3757
03:27:19,760 --> 03:27:23,300
I guess I did go kind of far in the nether, but not that far, right?

3758
03:27:32,900 --> 03:27:35,280
This looks like a perfect place for a beacon, by the way.

3759
03:27:36,240 --> 03:27:39,360
Kind of reminds me of that mountain from, uh...

3760
03:27:39,360 --> 03:27:40,840
Close Encounters of the Third Kind.

3761
03:27:42,020 --> 03:27:42,840
Just a bit.

3762
03:27:51,840 --> 03:27:52,800
Wow, look at that.

3763
03:27:55,880 --> 03:27:57,900
The biome is changing right there.

3764
03:28:00,580 --> 03:28:02,080
We see the edge of it.

3765
03:28:05,950 --> 03:28:07,250
Huh, that's kind of funny.

3766
03:28:07,870 --> 03:28:10,050
Mountain is straight in the middle of a biome change.

3767
03:28:12,090 --> 03:28:13,390
I kind of want to take a picture of that.

3768
03:28:13,770 --> 03:28:14,450
It's kind of neat.

3769
03:28:15,290 --> 03:28:16,290
Let's get rid of the shield.

3770
03:28:23,500 --> 03:28:24,080
Wait, what was it?

3771
03:28:24,200 --> 03:28:24,320
Oh.

3772
03:28:24,680 --> 03:28:24,860
Oops.

3773
03:28:25,600 --> 03:28:26,040
F2.

3774
03:28:26,360 --> 03:28:26,760
There we go.

3775
03:28:27,660 --> 03:28:28,100
Nice.

3776
03:28:29,880 --> 03:28:30,720
Throw that away.

3777
03:28:41,440 --> 03:28:43,120
Speaking of biomes...

3778
03:28:43,580 --> 03:28:44,700
How many have I discovered?

3779
03:28:47,260 --> 03:28:48,340
42 of 54.

3780
03:28:48,900 --> 03:28:49,340
Damn!

3781
03:28:49,920 --> 03:28:50,360
Really?

3782
03:28:51,380 --> 03:28:52,760
I have some exploring to do.

3783
03:28:53,900 --> 03:28:55,040
How is that even real?

3784
03:28:55,060 --> 03:28:55,920
I feel like I've been everywhere.

3785
03:28:56,540 --> 03:28:58,480
I even went to, uh...

3786
03:28:58,480 --> 03:28:59,420
the island...

3787
03:29:00,200 --> 03:29:01,280
with, uh...

3788
03:29:01,280 --> 03:29:02,080
mushrooms on it.

3789
03:29:03,120 --> 03:29:04,440
That also counts as one.

3790
03:29:06,300 --> 03:29:07,120
Biome, that is.

3791
03:29:10,730 --> 03:29:12,150
We're in the desert right now.

3792
03:29:18,230 --> 03:29:19,290
Ah, let's go to bed.

3793
03:29:37,740 --> 03:29:39,240
Another biome over here.

3794
03:29:43,610 --> 03:29:44,370
Wait a minute!

3795
03:29:44,630 --> 03:29:45,430
There's an achievement!

3796
03:29:48,820 --> 03:29:49,340
Somewhere.

3797
03:29:50,400 --> 03:29:50,880
Husbandry.

3798
03:29:57,650 --> 03:29:58,130
Uh...

3799
03:29:58,130 --> 03:29:58,750
Wait, where is it?

3800
03:30:01,410 --> 03:30:04,050
Get armadillo scoots from an armadillo...

3801
03:30:04,050 --> 03:30:04,790
Oh...

3802
03:30:04,790 --> 03:30:05,770
Using a brush?

3803
03:30:07,690 --> 03:30:09,010
The thing I didn't bring?

3804
03:30:10,850 --> 03:30:11,330
Uh...

3805
03:30:11,330 --> 03:30:11,690
Wait a minute.

3806
03:30:11,770 --> 03:30:12,370
How do I make one?

3807
03:30:24,950 --> 03:30:26,130
I have none of that.

3808
03:30:27,710 --> 03:30:28,890
That ain't happening, bro.

3809
03:30:29,670 --> 03:30:30,030
Fuck!

3810
03:30:34,240 --> 03:30:34,720
Fine.

3811
03:30:34,720 --> 03:30:34,800
Fine.

3812
03:30:36,280 --> 03:30:37,360
I guess I'll be back.

3813
03:30:39,420 --> 03:30:40,280
Wait, can I...

3814
03:30:40,280 --> 03:30:40,640
Wait, wait.

3815
03:30:40,760 --> 03:30:41,440
I have an idea, I have an idea.

3816
03:30:42,540 --> 03:30:46,000
If I can't bring the brush to you, can I bring you to the brush?

3817
03:30:53,390 --> 03:30:53,810
Yes!

3818
03:30:55,330 --> 03:30:55,750
Ha!

3819
03:30:55,990 --> 03:30:57,250
You coming with me, baby!

3820
03:30:58,270 --> 03:30:59,030
Hell yeah!

3821
03:31:00,130 --> 03:31:01,090
That's what I like.

3822
03:31:02,390 --> 03:31:03,070
That's nice.

3823
03:31:06,830 --> 03:31:07,870
Very cool.

3824
03:31:10,790 --> 03:31:12,350
What noise are you making?

3825
03:31:14,090 --> 03:31:15,030
Do it again.

3826
03:31:23,510 --> 03:31:24,370
I can...

3827
03:31:24,370 --> 03:31:26,030
I can voice act the armadillo.

3828
03:31:26,030 --> 03:31:26,050
Hello?

3829
03:31:34,920 --> 03:31:36,640
I see a village over there, by the way.

3830
03:31:39,850 --> 03:31:40,330
Oh!

3831
03:31:41,490 --> 03:31:41,970
Hello!

3832
03:31:42,790 --> 03:31:43,270
Hello!

3833
03:31:44,530 --> 03:31:45,490
Excuse me.

3834
03:31:49,890 --> 03:31:51,030
Show me the chest.

3835
03:31:53,900 --> 03:31:55,840
I feel like a real archaeologist right now.

3836
03:32:06,710 --> 03:32:07,930
Show me the chest.

3837
03:32:09,930 --> 03:32:10,970
Come on, I know it's here.

3838
03:32:14,640 --> 03:32:15,080
Ah!

3839
03:32:15,260 --> 03:32:15,540
Ha ha!

3840
03:32:15,740 --> 03:32:16,260
There it is!

3841
03:32:19,970 --> 03:32:20,830
Protection 3.

3842
03:32:20,970 --> 03:32:21,830
Curse of Vanishing.

3843
03:32:22,410 --> 03:32:22,770
Uh...

3844
03:32:22,770 --> 03:32:23,250
Golden apple.

3845
03:32:24,590 --> 03:32:25,830
Yeah, I hate all of this.

3846
03:32:26,850 --> 03:32:27,790
Although, you know what?

3847
03:32:27,850 --> 03:32:28,890
Golden boots with protection?

3848
03:32:29,290 --> 03:32:30,170
Not the worst.

3849
03:32:31,690 --> 03:32:32,370
I'll take it.

3850
03:32:33,550 --> 03:32:35,670
We can enchant those later to become even better.

3851
03:32:36,630 --> 03:32:38,010
In fact, you know what?

3852
03:32:38,570 --> 03:32:39,010
Hello?

3853
03:32:40,250 --> 03:32:42,150
Mending on armor is kinda nuts!

3854
03:32:44,010 --> 03:32:46,030
Imagine having mending on all pieces of armor.

3855
03:32:46,170 --> 03:32:46,950
They will never...

3856
03:32:46,950 --> 03:32:47,590
Die!

3857
03:32:48,210 --> 03:32:49,610
I mean, they'll never get...

3858
03:32:49,610 --> 03:32:50,290
Distri...

3859
03:32:51,070 --> 03:32:51,430
Come...

3860
03:32:51,430 --> 03:32:51,950
Destroyed.

3861
03:32:52,130 --> 03:32:52,450
Jesus.

3862
03:32:53,050 --> 03:32:53,710
Can't speak.

3863
03:32:55,010 --> 03:32:55,370
But...

3864
03:32:55,370 --> 03:32:55,950
Mending!

3865
03:32:57,690 --> 03:32:58,050
No!

3866
03:32:58,150 --> 03:32:59,770
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

3867
03:32:59,950 --> 03:33:00,650
Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck.

3868
03:33:02,730 --> 03:33:03,670
There's my boat, there's my boat.

3869
03:33:07,780 --> 03:33:08,820
Wait, are you drowning?

3870
03:33:09,000 --> 03:33:09,340
What's happening?

3871
03:33:10,380 --> 03:33:11,480
Are you alright there, buddy?

3872
03:33:12,960 --> 03:33:13,680
There you go.

3873
03:33:15,280 --> 03:33:16,040
There you go.

3874
03:33:17,000 --> 03:33:17,840
Alright, let's get home.

3875
03:33:20,080 --> 03:33:21,760
I'll have to take the long way around.

3876
03:33:28,630 --> 03:33:29,070
Oh!

3877
03:33:30,330 --> 03:33:31,930
We've got a shipwreck!

3878
03:33:33,530 --> 03:33:33,970
But...

3879
03:33:33,970 --> 03:33:35,390
We're not gonna deal with that now.

3880
03:33:40,990 --> 03:33:42,130
I wanna go straight home.

3881
03:33:58,690 --> 03:33:59,710
Look at all this.

3882
03:34:02,290 --> 03:34:04,490
Man, I need to figure out how to make an invisibility potion.

3883
03:34:09,060 --> 03:34:09,780
I need...

3884
03:34:09,780 --> 03:34:16,320
I need to systematically check absolutely every ingredient that I have or I can make.

3885
03:34:18,680 --> 03:34:21,460
And maybe I need to think outside the box as well here.

3886
03:34:25,440 --> 03:34:26,580
What was that sound?

3887
03:34:28,240 --> 03:34:30,340
Did the armadillo just go...

3888
03:34:32,060 --> 03:34:33,420
Or like...

3889
03:34:33,420 --> 03:34:35,440
With the armadillo mouth?

3890
03:34:36,700 --> 03:34:39,880
As far as I'm aware, armadillo mouths don't do that.

3891
03:34:40,940 --> 03:34:42,860
Armadillo mouths do something else.

3892
03:34:45,880 --> 03:34:46,220
Anyway.

3893
03:34:47,200 --> 03:34:49,040
That's enough about armadillo mouths.

3894
03:34:55,900 --> 03:34:57,280
Is that what I think it is?

3895
03:34:58,040 --> 03:34:58,760
It's a tree!

3896
03:34:58,900 --> 03:34:59,340
I knew it!

3897
03:34:59,440 --> 03:35:00,120
I thought it was a...

3898
03:35:00,120 --> 03:35:00,920
I thought it was a tree.

3899
03:35:01,580 --> 03:35:02,340
And I was right.

3900
03:35:04,340 --> 03:35:06,140
Man, I went far in the nether!

3901
03:35:06,240 --> 03:35:07,060
Holy shit!

3902
03:35:09,800 --> 03:35:11,000
This is a long trip.

3903
03:35:26,970 --> 03:35:27,370
Oh!

3904
03:35:27,650 --> 03:35:28,050
No!

3905
03:35:28,250 --> 03:35:29,030
I thought it was a portal.

3906
03:35:32,190 --> 03:35:32,990
I mean...

3907
03:35:32,990 --> 03:35:35,390
Is there anything of note in this biome?

3908
03:35:42,770 --> 03:35:43,990
I don't see anything.

3909
03:35:52,300 --> 03:35:53,440
Speaking of potions...

3910
03:35:53,440 --> 03:35:53,740
Wait a minute.

3911
03:35:55,480 --> 03:35:58,300
There's gotta be some ingredients down here that can be used in potions, no?

3912
03:35:59,660 --> 03:36:02,820
I think I tried a sea pickle once, but I'm not 100% sure.

3913
03:36:04,780 --> 03:36:05,840
Oh, these get destroyed.

3914
03:36:13,240 --> 03:36:13,940
What is that?

3915
03:36:15,420 --> 03:36:16,600
Oh, weird fish.

3916
03:36:20,640 --> 03:36:21,040
Um...

3917
03:36:21,900 --> 03:36:22,300
Yeah.

3918
03:36:22,500 --> 03:36:23,480
I'm gonna try a sea pickle.

3919
03:36:25,840 --> 03:36:27,580
Otherwise, I will eat the pickle.

3920
03:36:29,460 --> 03:36:31,440
I will chop it up and put it on a burger.

3921
03:36:32,340 --> 03:36:33,340
Sea pickle burger.

3922
03:36:35,200 --> 03:36:36,040
Sounds good, though.

3923
03:36:49,890 --> 03:36:52,210
Man, how far away from home am I, actually?

3924
03:36:52,570 --> 03:36:52,970
Oh!

3925
03:36:53,150 --> 03:36:53,750
I just remembered.

3926
03:36:53,790 --> 03:36:54,910
I wanted to do mapping, too.

3927
03:36:56,050 --> 03:36:57,710
We should put that on the, uh...

3928
03:36:58,670 --> 03:36:59,410
The bop.

3929
03:36:59,650 --> 03:37:00,410
When we get home.

3930
03:37:01,190 --> 03:37:01,710
Another village.

3931
03:37:01,710 --> 03:37:01,750
A village.

3932
03:37:02,890 --> 03:37:03,430
No, wait.

3933
03:37:03,450 --> 03:37:03,910
Is that a village?

3934
03:37:07,650 --> 03:37:08,090
I...

3935
03:37:08,090 --> 03:37:08,390
Mmm.

3936
03:37:08,890 --> 03:37:10,310
Not 100% sure that's a village.

3937
03:37:10,870 --> 03:37:12,290
That could be, uh...

3938
03:37:12,290 --> 03:37:13,310
The booby trap place.

3939
03:37:14,970 --> 03:37:16,850
Yeah, in fact, now that I think about it...

3940
03:37:16,850 --> 03:37:18,690
The markings on the walls there...

3941
03:37:18,690 --> 03:37:20,370
Looks like the booby trap area.

3942
03:37:36,750 --> 03:37:37,630
What do we got here?

3943
03:37:46,560 --> 03:37:47,000
Huh.

3944
03:37:48,240 --> 03:37:48,680
Alright.

3945
03:37:50,240 --> 03:37:52,500
I was expecting a chest in there or something.

3946
03:38:02,540 --> 03:38:03,820
What should I name you, huh?

3947
03:38:04,900 --> 03:38:06,100
Little rascal you.

3948
03:38:08,840 --> 03:38:09,320
Maybe...

3949
03:38:10,840 --> 03:38:11,620
I don't know.

3950
03:38:15,960 --> 03:38:17,160
Old Dirty Bastard.

3951
03:38:18,060 --> 03:38:19,040
That'll be your name.

3952
03:38:21,120 --> 03:38:22,320
I like that name.

3953
03:38:26,970 --> 03:38:28,050
Got a ship break here.

3954
03:38:28,050 --> 03:38:28,850
But...

3955
03:38:28,850 --> 03:38:30,970
It's completely dirtied up.

3956
03:38:31,770 --> 03:38:32,350
Almost.

3957
03:38:32,570 --> 03:38:32,710
Wait.

3958
03:38:34,750 --> 03:38:36,510
I'll take paper any day.

3959
03:38:38,900 --> 03:38:40,510
You can have...

3960
03:38:41,050 --> 03:38:41,590
This.

3961
03:38:43,800 --> 03:38:44,550
Good enough.

3962
03:38:45,530 --> 03:38:46,950
Oh wait, I have a...

3963
03:38:46,950 --> 03:38:47,670
Rebreather on.

3964
03:38:47,930 --> 03:38:48,550
I'm fine.

3965
03:38:50,960 --> 03:38:51,910
Mending on that.

3966
03:38:52,410 --> 03:38:53,310
Mending on...

3967
03:38:54,050 --> 03:38:54,590
Jesus.

3968
03:38:56,230 --> 03:38:57,850
I guess it's not that rare out here.

3969
03:38:58,010 --> 03:38:59,050
I knew it's shipwrecks, man.

3970
03:38:59,190 --> 03:39:00,270
Shipwrecks are the source.

3971
03:39:02,190 --> 03:39:03,610
To find mending things.

3972
03:39:06,450 --> 03:39:06,950
Like...

3973
03:39:07,590 --> 03:39:08,450
Mostly, I would say.

3974
03:39:08,850 --> 03:39:09,670
I've had...

3975
